{"title": "Bolstering Smite", "pageid": 28376, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Bolstering_Smite", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Bugs", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Bolstering Smite</b> is a passive feature that gives the wearer temporary hit points when they inflict a condition with a smite.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>When you apply a condition with one of your Smite spells, you gain <a href=\"/wiki/Temporary_Hit_Points\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Temporary Hit Points\">Temporary Hit Points</a> equal to your <a href=\"/wiki/Charisma\" title=\"Charisma\">Charisma modifier</a>. \n</p><p><span style=\"color: white;\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Prerequisite_Icon.png/25px-Prerequisite_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Prerequisite_Icon.png/38px-Prerequisite_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Prerequisite_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Prerequisite Icon.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Prerequisite_Icon.png/25px-Prerequisite_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Prerequisite_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span><span class=\"bg3wiki-prereq\">Can only have temporary hit points from one source.</span></span>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div><h2><span id=\"Condition:_Temporary_Hit_Points_.28Bolstering_Smite.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Temporary_Hit_Points_(Bolstering_Smite)\"> Condition: Temporary Hit Points (Bolstering Smite) </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Temporary_Hit_Points_(Bolstering_Smite)_(Condition)\" title=\"Temporary Hit Points (Bolstering Smite) (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/10/Temporary_Hit_Points_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Temporary_Hit_Points_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/10/Temporary_Hit_Points_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Temporary_Hit_Points_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/10/Temporary_Hit_Points_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Temporary_Hit_Points_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Temporary Hit Points\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/10/Temporary_Hit_Points_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Temporary_Hit_Points_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/10/Temporary_Hit_Points_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Temporary_Hit_Points_(Bolstering_Smite)_(Condition)\" title=\"Temporary Hit Points (Bolstering Smite) (Condition)\">Temporary Hit Points</a></strong>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Gained <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/HP_Icon.png/25px-HP_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/25/HP_Icon.png/38px-HP_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/2/25/HP_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Charisma modifier temporary hit points\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/HP_Icon.png/25px-HP_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/25/HP_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Charisma modifier <a href=\"/wiki/Temporary_Hit_Points\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Temporary Hit Points\">temporary hit points</a> from <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bolstering_Smite\" title=\"Bolstering Smite\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a9/Generic_Feature_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Feature_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a9/Generic_Feature_Icon.webp/38px-Generic_Feature_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a9/Generic_Feature_Icon.webp/50px-Generic_Feature_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bolstering Smite\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a9/Generic_Feature_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Feature_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a9/Generic_Feature_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Bolstering Smite</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the equipment:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Helmet_of_Smiting\" title=\"Helmet of Smiting\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/93/Metal_Helmet_Magical_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Metal_Helmet_Magical_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/93/Metal_Helmet_Magical_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Metal_Helmet_Magical_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/93/Metal_Helmet_Magical_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Metal_Helmet_Magical_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/93/Metal_Helmet_Magical_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Metal_Helmet_Magical_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/93/Metal_Helmet_Magical_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Helmet_of_Smiting\" title=\"Helmet of Smiting\">Helmet of Smiting</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>The spells that currently work with Bolstering Smite are: <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Banishing_Smite\" title=\"Banishing Smite\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3b/Banishing_Smite_Melee_Icon.webp/20px-Banishing_Smite_Melee_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3b/Banishing_Smite_Melee_Icon.webp/30px-Banishing_Smite_Melee_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3b/Banishing_Smite_Melee_Icon.webp/40px-Banishing_Smite_Melee_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Banishing Smite\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3b/Banishing_Smite_Melee_Icon.webp/20px-Banishing_Smite_Melee_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3b/Banishing_Smite_Melee_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Banishing_Smite\" title=\"Banishing Smite\">Banishing Smite</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Blinding_Smite\" title=\"Blinding Smite\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5e/Blinding_Smite_Icon.webp/20px-Blinding_Smite_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5e/Blinding_Smite_Icon.webp/30px-Blinding_Smite_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5e/Blinding_Smite_Icon.webp/40px-Blinding_Smite_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Blinding Smite\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5e/Blinding_Smite_Icon.webp/20px-Blinding_Smite_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5e/Blinding_Smite_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Blinding_Smite\" title=\"Blinding Smite\">Blinding Smite</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Branding_Smite\" title=\"Branding Smite\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5e/Branding_Smite_Melee_Icon.webp/20px-Branding_Smite_Melee_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5e/Branding_Smite_Melee_Icon.webp/30px-Branding_Smite_Melee_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5e/Branding_Smite_Melee_Icon.webp/40px-Branding_Smite_Melee_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Branding Smite\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5e/Branding_Smite_Melee_Icon.webp/20px-Branding_Smite_Melee_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5e/Branding_Smite_Melee_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Branding_Smite\" title=\"Branding Smite\">Branding Smite</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Searing_Smite\" title=\"Searing Smite\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/50/Searing_Smite_Icon.webp/20px-Searing_Smite_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/50/Searing_Smite_Icon.webp/30px-Searing_Smite_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/50/Searing_Smite_Icon.webp/40px-Searing_Smite_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Searing Smite\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/50/Searing_Smite_Icon.webp/20px-Searing_Smite_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/50/Searing_Smite_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Searing_Smite\" title=\"Searing Smite\">Searing Smite</a>, and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Wrathful_Smite\" title=\"Wrathful Smite\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/79/Wrathful_Smite_Icon.webp/20px-Wrathful_Smite_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/79/Wrathful_Smite_Icon.webp/30px-Wrathful_Smite_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/79/Wrathful_Smite_Icon.webp/40px-Wrathful_Smite_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Wrathful Smite\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/79/Wrathful_Smite_Icon.webp/20px-Wrathful_Smite_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/79/Wrathful_Smite_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Wrathful_Smite\" title=\"Wrathful Smite\">Wrathful Smite</a>.</li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>Bolstering Smite does not function with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Thunderous_Smite\" title=\"Thunderous Smite\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/dd/Thunderous_Smite_Icon.webp/20px-Thunderous_Smite_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/dd/Thunderous_Smite_Icon.webp/30px-Thunderous_Smite_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/dd/Thunderous_Smite_Icon.webp/40px-Thunderous_Smite_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Thunderous Smite\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/dd/Thunderous_Smite_Icon.webp/20px-Thunderous_Smite_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/dd/Thunderous_Smite_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Thunderous_Smite\" title=\"Thunderous Smite\">Thunderous Smite</a> or <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Staggering_Smite\" title=\"Staggering Smite\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/03/Staggering_Smite_Icon.webp/20px-Staggering_Smite_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/03/Staggering_Smite_Icon.webp/30px-Staggering_Smite_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/03/Staggering_Smite_Icon.webp/40px-Staggering_Smite_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Staggering Smite\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/03/Staggering_Smite_Icon.webp/20px-Staggering_Smite_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/03/Staggering_Smite_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Staggering_Smite\" title=\"Staggering Smite\">Staggering Smite</a>.</li>\n<li>Any application of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Frightened_(Condition)\" title=\"Frightened (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/75/Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/75/Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/75/Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Frightened\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/75/Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/75/Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Frightened_(Condition)\" title=\"Frightened (Condition)\">Frightened</a> by the wearer triggers Bolstering Smite.</li>\n<li>Though not stated in the description, the temporary hit points only last for two turns.\n<ul><li>The temporary hit points only have a <code>StackPriority</code> of 1, and as such are overridden by any other source of temporary hit points which have a <code>StackPriority</code> of 1 or higher, even if the new source is of a lesser value.</li></ul></li></ul>\n</div> 